EXACT SOLUTION OF THE PRIME ISING CHAIN:

  The 1D Ising model with couplings {J_i} and field h has:
  H = -sum_i J_i * sigma_i * sigma_{i+1} - h * sum_i sigma_i

  Exact partition function (transfer matrix method):
  Z(beta, h) = Tr(T_1 * T_2 * ... * T_{N-1})
  where T_i = [[exp(beta*J_i + beta*h), exp(-beta*J_i)]
                [exp(-beta*J_i), exp(beta*J_i - beta*h)]]

  Chain length: 21 spins (primes 2 through 73)

    beta         ln(Z)         <E>/N         <m>           C/N           S/N
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------
